/F2 14 Tf (LAB 4: VIBE CODING - LLM CHAT HISTORY & TRAJECTORY) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F1 9.5 Tf (Student SRN: PES1UG24CS384) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (Scenario: 15 \(Connect Four vs AI\)) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (Claude Chat Share Link: https://claude.ai/share/56914cc2-0791-40fb-b8c1-a1e3acbea036) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (Deliverable: \(c\) Complete Chat History Document / PDF) '
/F1 9.5 Tf () '
/F2 11 Tf (1. OVERVIEW & INITIAL BUG REPRODUCTION) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf (Original Defect Identified:) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F1 9.5 Tf (In board.py, the winner\(token\) method checked only horizontal \(0, 1\) and vertical \(1, 0\)) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (directions. Both diagonal directions \(1, 1\) down-right and \(1, -1\) down-left were omitted.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (Additionally, the AI in ai.py made purely random choices without detecting 1-move threats.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (The 'before.mp4' video was recorded demonstrating these original flaws.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf () '
/F2 11 Tf (2. ITERATION 1: TASK 1 - COMPLETE WIN DETECTION) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf (User Prompt 1:) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F1 9.5 Tf (    'In board.py, update the winner method to detect 4-in-a-row in all four directions: horizontal,) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    vertical, diagonal down-right \(1, 1\), and diagonal down-left \(1, -1\). Ensure shorter sequences) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    do not count as wins.') '
/F2 9.5 Tf (LLM Implementation Applied in board.py:) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (    def winner\(self, token\):) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (        directions = [\(0, 1\), \(1, 0\), \(1, 1\), \(1, -1\)]) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (        for r in range\(ROWS\):) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (            for c in range\(COLS\):) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (                if self.grid[r][c] != token: continue) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (                for dr, dc in directions:) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (                    if all\(0 <= r + i*dr < ROWS and 0 <= c + i*dc < COLS and) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (                           self.grid[r + i*dr][c + i*dc] == token for i in range\(4\)\):) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (                        return True) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F3 8.5 Tf (        return False) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F1 9.5 Tf (Result: Task 1 Verified & Committed \(Commit: Task 1: Complete win detection\).) '
/F1 9.5 Tf () '
/F2 11 Tf (3. ITERATION 2: TASK 2 - GAME TERMINATION & INPUT VALIDATION) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf (User Prompt 2:) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F1 9.5 Tf (    'In game.py, ensure proper input validation for column numbers \(1 to 7\), clean error messages) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    when a column is full or invalid without crashing, and ensure winning moves and draws terminate) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    the game cleanly.') '
/F2 9.5 Tf (LLM Implementation Applied in game.py:) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
/F1 9.5 Tf (    - Added bounds checking \(1 to 7\) and ValueError handling for non-numeric input.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    - Added clean error message when a column is already full without crashing.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    - Handled 'q' and KeyboardInterrupt cleanly to exit without unhandled exceptions.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (    - Ensured winning moves and full board conditions terminate the game loop immediately.) '
/F1 9.5 Tf (Result: Task 2 Verified & Committed \(Commit: Task 2: Complete game termination\).) '
/F1 9.5 Tf () '
/F2 11 Tf (4. ITERATION 3: TASK 3 - INTELLIGENT AI DECISION MAKING) ' /F1 9.5 Tf
